==Battleground==
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The 4th Angel (Enemy)|The 4th Angel]] spawns as the boss.
**9 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**6 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

